  "description": "Safari Tropical Animal Clipart. Watercolor Baby jungle elephant, sloth, tiger, lion, giraffe. Baby shower, birthday party set.\nIdeal for playroom decoration, birth announcements, nursery art, and general design of any product for very young explorers of the wild nature. With this amazing hawaii hand painted design collection you can create your unique, tender and creative DIY design in tropical jungle style. This collection perfect for baby shirt design, nursery decor, card making, party invitations, invitations, stationery, party tags, blog design, logos, digital scrapbooking, packaging, greeting cards, posters, banners, print fabrics, D.I.Y. and other projects.\nWhat’s included:\n15 animals and 7 animals with floral decor in PNG (transparent background 300dpi apr. 3000x4300px; 3500x2500px; 3600x4000px, 10×15”, 12×14”);\n24 individual florals elements and 6 arrangements in PNG (transparent background 300dpi apr. 4000x2300px; 1700x2900px; 2600x2400px, 13×8”, 5×10”, 8×6”);\n13 seamless pattern in Jpeg and PNG (300dpi 5000x5000px transparent background RGB, 3600x3600px 12×12”);\n4 cards templates in Jpeg (300dpi 4000x5600px transparent background RGB);",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Safari Tropical Animal Clipart. Watercolor Baby jungle elephant, sloth, tiger, lion, giraffe. Baby shower, birthday party set.</p>\n<p>Ideal for playroom decoration, birth announcements, nursery art, and general design of any product for very young explorers of the wild nature. With this amazing hawaii hand painted design collection you can create your unique, tender and creative DIY design in tropical jungle style. This collection perfect for baby shirt design, nursery decor, card making, party invitations, invitations, stationery, party tags, blog design, logos, digital scrapbooking, packaging, greeting cards, posters, banners, print fabrics, D.I.Y. and other projects.</p>\n<p>What’s included:<br>\n15 animals and 7 animals with floral decor in PNG (transparent background 300dpi apr. 3000x4300px; 3500x2500px; 3600x4000px, 10×15”, 12×14”);<br>\n24 individual florals elements and 6 arrangements in PNG (transparent background 300dpi apr. 4000x2300px; 1700x2900px; 2600x2400px, 13×8”, 5×10”, 8×6”);<br>\n13 seamless pattern in Jpeg and PNG (300dpi 5000x5000px transparent background RGB, 3600x3600px 12×12”);<br>\n4 cards templates in Jpeg (300dpi 4000x5600px transparent background RGB);</p>",
